{
  "sourceLanguage": "zh-Hans",
  "strings": {
    "%@ 已经是别的文件，不覆盖": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ is already another file; not overwriting it"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@://": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "%lld 秒": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld s"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "Claude Code 做完了": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code is done"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code 出错了": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code hit an error"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code 在等你回答": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code is waiting for your answer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code 在等你批准": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code is waiting for your approval"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code 没在运行": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code isn't running"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pip": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "Pip 只读它的 manifest.json，不运行里面的任何文件。装上后它发来的卡片会标明来源。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pip only reads its manifest.json and never runs any file inside. Cards it sends will show where they came from."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pip 要保留防火墙：之后一直开着，重启也开着。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pip wants to keep the firewall on: it stays on, even after a restart."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pip 要关闭防火墙。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pip wants to turn the firewall off."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pip 要卸载防火墙：清掉守护进程、规则和文件。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pip wants to uninstall the firewall: remove its daemon, rules, and files."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pip 要安装防火墙（装完是关着的，什么都不拦）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pip wants to install the firewall (it starts off and blocks nothing)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pip 要开启防火墙，先试运行 2 分钟。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pip wants to turn the firewall on, starting with a 2-minute trial."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SF Symbol 名，例如 externaldrive": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SF Symbol name, e.g. externaldrive"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "id": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "id 只能用小写字母、数字和连字符，至多 32 个字符": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The id may only contain lowercase letters, digits, and hyphens, up to 32 characters"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "id 是内置插件的（guard、claude），换一个": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "That id belongs to a built-in plugin (guard, claude); choose another"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "manifest.json 不是 JSON，或缺 id、name、symbol": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "manifest.json isn’t valid JSON, or is missing id, name, or symbol"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "pipctl": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "terminal 是自带的终端插件，在设置 › 终端里装卸": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "terminal is the bundled Terminal plugin; install or uninstall it in Settings › Terminal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "utun1024": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "zsh 里跑了 10 秒以上的命令结束时弹卡，点卡片跳回那个终端。你正看着那个终端时不弹（同一窗口的其他标签、分屏不算）。命令行只交出命令名，不带参数；vim、ssh、top 这类全屏或交互的命令不弹。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When a zsh command that ran for 10 seconds or more finishes, a card pops up; click it to jump back to that terminal. No card if you're looking at that very terminal (other tabs or splits in the same window don't count). From the command line, only the command name is sent, never its arguments. Full-screen or interactive commands like vim, ssh and top don't pop cards."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "~/.local/bin/pipctl 已经是别的文件，不覆盖；用下面的完整路径": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "~/.local/bin/pipctl is already another file and won’t be overwritten; use the full path below"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "—": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "上下翻圈": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Flip"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上次检查": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Last Check"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上移": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Move Up"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下移": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Move Down"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不常驻": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "None"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不弹卡，面板里也不显示会话": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No cards, and no sessions in the panel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不弹红卡，Pip 和面板也不显示出口；后台照常检查": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No red card, and Pip and the panel don't show the egress. Checks keep running in the background"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不是有效的 IPv4 地址，或已在列表里。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not a valid IPv4 address, or already in the list."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不是有效的 scheme，或已在列表里。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not a valid scheme, or already in the list."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "东张西望": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Look Around"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "低头看脚": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Look Down"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "例如 198.51.100.10": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "e.g. 198.51.100.10"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "例如 backup": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "e.g. backup"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "例如 raycast": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "e.g. raycast"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "侧身 90°": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn 90°"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保留": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "允许的出口 IP（IPv4）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allowed Egress IPs (IPv4)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "全选": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Select All"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关于": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "About"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关掉后左耳不显示 Pip；右耳也没有内容时，刘海就是一块纯黑。展开和弹卡时照常显示": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When off, the left ear has no Pip, and if the right ear is empty too the notch is plain black. Pip still appears when expanded and on cards"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关掉提醒": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn Off Alerts"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关掉插件只关提醒，出口守卫照常在后台检查。外部插件关掉后，它发来的卡片和活动都会丢掉。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turning a plugin off only silences its alerts; Egress Guard keeps checking in the background. While an external plugin is off, its cards and activities are discarded."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关着，什么都不拦": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off, blocking nothing"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关闭": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Close"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出了问题不能保留：什么都不用做，到时自动关掉": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Can’t keep while there’s a problem: do nothing and it turns off when time’s up"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出口 IP 不在允许列表里": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unexpected egress IP"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出口不符": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Egress Mismatch"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出口守卫": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Egress Guard"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出口守卫固定在最上面。各段合起来最多显示 %lld 行，排在前面的先占；多出来的在段里滚动。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The egress guard stays on top. All sections together show up to %lld rows, earlier sections first; the rest scroll within their section."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出口已恢复": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Egress recovered"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出口正常": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Egress OK"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出错": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Error"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "切换 App": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switch App"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "列出会话；做完、出错、等你时弹卡": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lists sessions; cards when done, on errors, or when waiting for you"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "列表为空时，守卫判断不了出口 IP 对不对，只能显示「暂时判断不了出口」；有流量没走代理仍然会报。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With an empty list the guard can't tell whether the egress IP is right, so it shows “Can't verify the egress”. Traffic bypassing the proxy is still reported."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "刘海": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notch"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "删掉终端插件的脚本，~/.zshrc 里那一行留着也不报错。之后终端发来的卡片都会丢掉。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deletes the terminal plugin’s script; the line in ~/.zshrc can stay without errors. Cards from the terminal will be dropped after this."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "剪切": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cut"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "卡上标明来源用，例如「备份」": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shown on its cards, e.g. “Backup”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "卡片停留": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Card Duration"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "卡片和面板里的链接默认只打开 https。这里加的 scheme 也放行：它们能让别的 App 执行动作，只加你信得过的。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Links in cards and the panel only open https by default. Schemes added here are allowed too; they can make other apps perform actions, so only add ones you trust."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "危险": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Danger"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "卸载": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uninstall"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "卸载…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uninstall…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "卸载「%@」？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uninstall “%@”?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "卸载防火墙？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uninstall the firewall?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "去公网的路由没走 Clash 的隧道": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Internet traffic is routed outside Clash's tunnel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "取消": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cancel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只改 Pip 和刘海的样子，不影响出口判定，也不弹红卡、不响；真的红卡照常弹出。不写入任何文件，重开 App 即恢复。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only changes how Pip and the notch look: the egress verdict is unaffected, and there's no red card or sound. Real red cards still pop up. Nothing is written to disk; relaunching the app restores everything."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只能用小写字母、数字和连字符，至多 32 个字符": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only lowercase letters, digits, and hyphens, up to 32 characters"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同 id 的插件已经装着": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A plugin with this id is already installed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "名字": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Name"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "名字至多 %lld 个字，图标名至多 %lld 个字符": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Name can be at most %lld characters, icon name at most %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "名字（name）和图标（symbol）不能是空的": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Name (name) and icon (symbol) can’t be empty"
          }
        }
      }
    },
