    "安装要管理员密码，装完是关着的，什么都不拦。隧道网卡填 Clash 的 TUN 网卡名，只收 utun 加数字（Clash Verge 默认 utun1024）：填错了开启后会把外网全拦掉。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installing needs an administrator password; the firewall starts off and blocks nothing. Enter Clash’s TUN interface name — utun followed by digits (Clash Verge defaults to utun1024): a wrong name blocks all internet traffic once the firewall is on."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "安装防火墙？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
