    "开着时，没走 Clash 隧道的流量除局域网、Clash 直连的地址和国内 IP 外一律拦下。每次开启先试运行 2 分钟，不点「保留」自动关掉。开启、保留、关闭都要管理员密码。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "While on, traffic that bypasses the Clash tunnel is blocked, except for the local network, addresses Clash connects to directly, and mainland China IPs. Each time you turn it on, it runs a 2-minute trial and turns itself off unless you click Keep. Turning on, keeping, and turning off all need an administrator password."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "异常：守护进程 30 秒没有更新状态，说不清在不在拦；关掉或卸载": {
      "localizations": {
